Project: {{config.metadata.name}} ({{stack}} / {{architecture}})
Doc language: {{language}}

Help register an identity provider integration (Keycloak, Auth0, Okta, AWS Cognito).
Return ONLY a JSON object — no Markdown fences, no prose.

User input:
"""
{{extra.userDescription}}
"""

Schema:
{
  "name": string,
  "vendor": string,
  "purpose": string,
  "endpoints": [{ "name": string, "protocol": string, "url": string }],
  "slaTargets": { "availability": string, "latencyP95Ms": number },
  "auth": { "mode": string, "secretsRef": string },
  "errorHandling": string,
  "rateLimits": string,
  "observability": string,
  "versioning": string,
  "extra": {
    "vendor": string,
    "realms": string[],
    "clients": string[],
    "scopes": string[],
    "tokenLifetime": string,
    "refreshLifetime": string,
    "federation": string[]
  }
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id".
- Specify token lifetimes, refresh policy, federation providers.

Return JSON only.
